# McCoy, Not a Bricklayer (0/4): "Creatures you control with counters on them have lifelink" (CR 613.1f, 702.15a).
# Memnite takes its counter when McCoy enters on turn 3, then hits Bot2 for 2 on turn 5: lifelink gains Bot1 2 (at 22).
# A second Memnite cast on turn 5 takes no counter and hits for 1 on turn 7: with no counters it has no lifelink, so
# Bot1 stays at 20. Bot2's Doctor entering on turn 6 fires nothing - it is not yours - so the first Memnite stays 2/2,
# and Bot2's Bears hitting for 2 gains Bot2 nothing (at 17) while Bot1 falls to 20.

